{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1258502-one-shot-psychics-game","id":1258502,"title":"One shot Psychics game?!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-01T22:46:02-07:00","id":1258502,"title":"One shot Psychics game?!","content":"I think I want to hold a housewarming party since I got a new apartment and I may try to hold a one shot for some co-workers. And it being October I think a one shot mostly mortals game would emphasize the horror and be the simplest!<br /> <br /> A chronicles game would probably be the best at conveying the horror but CWOD would be simplest and easiest to run. So I\u2019ll probably have everyone make characters who maybe either went to the same college or live in the same apartment building. They will encounter and accidentally I interrupt a cults soul sacrifice and be caught in a backlash that awakens Psychic Numina in all of them. If I\u2019m lucky this could convince them to make it more then a one shot but it\u2019s hard<br /> To do games with coworkers because we would t have our days off together!<br /> <br /> But it would be simple and fun!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-06T08:02:01-07:00","id":1259231,"title":"","content":"Seems a great idea <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/250518/Dark-Shores-Lineages--of-the-Great-Lakes\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Dark Shores: Lineages of the Great Lakes</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/264262/Fingers-of-the-Eldest-Bogatyri\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Fingers of the Eldest: Bogatyri</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/295115/Forgotten-Alliances\" target=\"_blank\">WTA: Forgotten Alliances</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24483-salamander","name":"SalamanDer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24483_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-03T02:21:33-07:00","id":1264396,"title":"","content":"Originally I had the idea the being being summoned was some sort of Bane, or God or Spirit. And they being uses the souls of the sacrifices for fuel and gifts the cultists. But now I am thinking it may be more fun to have the being summoned as some sort of Fae, maybe even A true Fae like a Fomorian. The idea being they used mighty Unleashings, and the players stumble and become the target of the utterance \u201cAwaken\u201d. This opens up their souls potential. Maybe even they sacrifice a Mage for the ritual.<br /> <br /> I mean we don\u2019t really have many limits on Unleashings, and even less of say the ritual involves hallucinogens to send ones mind into the Deep Dreaming where a True Fae is like Unto a God.<br /> <br /> And if they get enchanted they can awaken memories from childhood. This would be a potential 2nd part prequel of the one shot where everyone plays tweens who become enchanted and have an adventure together before the enchantment eventually wears off or maybe their patron dies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":